1
00:00:01,375 --> 00:00:02,375
What did you say?

2
00:00:03,369 --> 00:00:05,620
You mean you sent Genin after Sasuke?

3
00:00:06,499 --> 00:00:08,100
Well, what else could I do?

4
00:00:08,710 --> 00:00:11,300
You know the state that this village is in
right now.

5
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:17,320
Hey!

6
00:00:17,575 --> 00:00:18,600
Where are you going?

7
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:20,700
You already have a mission assigned to
you!

8
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:23,020
I have to go run an errand first.

9
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:24,280
Be back in a bit.

10
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:25,700
Don't worry.

11
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:31,320
Oh, brother...

12
00:00:32,980 --> 00:00:34,060
Summoning Jutsu!

13
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:47,070
Okay, guys.

14
00:00:47,410 --> 00:00:50,410
Fan out and start searching for Naruto and
Sasuke's scent.

15
00:00:51,310 --> 00:00:53,550
Did you say Naruto and Sasuke?

16
00:00:54,350 --> 00:00:55,410
What's going on?

17
00:00:55,470 --> 00:00:56,790
What happened to the two of them?

18
00:00:57,110 --> 00:00:58,290
I'll explain later.

19
00:00:58,710 --> 00:01:00,630
Right now, time is of the essence.

20
00:01:01,470 --> 00:01:02,470
Right.

21
00:01:03,230 --> 00:01:05,610
Let me know as soon as you pick up their
scent.

22
00:01:05,870 --> 00:01:07,010
I'll be there immediately.

23
00:01:07,011 --> 00:01:08,510
All right.

24
00:01:09,150 --> 00:01:10,150
Scatter!

25
00:01:17,169 --> 00:01:20,660
Well, they did go at each other right
before her eyes.

26
00:01:21,789 --> 00:01:24,040
Guess there's no point in telling her not
to worry.

27
00:01:30,890 --> 00:01:32,650
I hope I'm not too late.

28
00:03:23,320 --> 00:03:24,320
Sasuke!

29
00:03:32,990 --> 00:03:33,870
Sasuke!

30
00:03:33,871 --> 00:03:35,130
Are you going to run off again?

31
00:03:47,730 --> 00:03:49,330
So it's you.

32
00:03:50,590 --> 00:03:52,690
Hopeless little knucklehead.

33
00:03:56,190 --> 00:03:57,810
She sent you, huh?

34
00:04:01,810 --> 00:04:04,430
I did everything I could.

35
00:04:05,390 --> 00:04:09,130
I tried, but I couldn't stop him from
leaving the village.

36
00:04:10,070 --> 00:04:14,250
At this point, there's only one person who
can stop him.

37
00:04:15,070 --> 00:04:16,790
Only one who can save him.

38
00:04:18,589 --> 00:04:20,950
Naruto, it's all up to you.

39
00:04:22,530 --> 00:04:23,530
Naruto...

40
00:04:24,295 --> 00:04:27,430
This is a... once-in-a-lifetime request.

41
00:04:28,470 --> 00:04:29,950
Just bring him home.

42
00:04:30,930 --> 00:04:32,910
Please bring Sasuke back to me.

43
00:04:36,390 --> 00:04:37,470
Look at you.

44
00:04:37,710 --> 00:04:39,030
What's with the angry face?

45
00:04:47,190 --> 00:04:51,610
You know, you asked Sakura for advice when
she was here.

46
00:04:52,310 --> 00:04:54,250
So what did she tell you?

47
00:04:57,650 --> 00:04:59,030
Let's go back.

48
00:04:59,790 --> 00:05:00,790
All right.

49
00:05:04,070 --> 00:05:08,610
Why did you... I don't know.

50
00:05:08,990 --> 00:05:09,010
I don't know either.

51
00:05:09,770 --> 00:05:11,790
My body just moved.

52
00:05:12,085 --> 00:05:13,810
There was no time to think.

53
00:05:18,590 --> 00:05:23,030
You have to save Sakura if it's the last
thing you do.

54
00:05:24,230 --> 00:05:25,230
Sasuke...

55
00:05:25,730 --> 00:05:30,990
You... I can hold him
here a little longer.

56
00:05:32,150 --> 00:05:34,330
I lost everything once.

57
00:05:35,219 --> 00:05:37,590
I don't ever want to have to see that
again.

58
00:05:39,390 --> 00:05:43,130
My trusted comrades falling right in front
of me.

59
00:05:47,080 --> 00:05:48,080
Why?

60
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:51,000
Why are you doing this to us?

61
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:54,900
I don't get it!

62
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:56,620
What happened to make you like this?

63
00:05:57,060 --> 00:05:58,320
Why are you doing it?

64
00:06:02,640 --> 00:06:04,680
Why should you care what I do?

65
00:06:04,980 --> 00:06:06,760
It's my concern, not yours.

66
00:06:06,761 --> 00:06:10,900
I have my own path to follow now.

67
00:06:11,580 --> 00:06:14,940
And neither you nor anyone else can steer
me from it.

68
00:06:16,580 --> 00:06:18,500
I will tell you this much.

69
00:06:19,380 --> 00:06:25,200
My days of playing ninja with you kids of
the Leaf Village... are done.

70
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:33,980
All of them.

71
00:06:35,460 --> 00:06:38,320
They all risked their lives.

72
00:06:39,280 --> 00:06:40,280
And why?

73
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:41,480
To save you!

74
00:06:43,340 --> 00:06:45,320
Well, wasn't that nice of them.

75
00:06:46,300 --> 00:06:47,300
Sasuke...

76
00:06:58,110 --> 00:07:02,670
Since no one has anything to add,
I saved the most important thing for last.

77
00:07:03,350 --> 00:07:07,330
For as long as I've known him, Sasuke
and I haven't exactly been close buddies.

78
00:07:07,650 --> 00:07:09,650
In fact, I don't really like him at all.

79
00:07:10,410 --> 00:07:13,810
All the same, Sasuke's a ninja belonging
to the Hidden Leaf Village.

80
00:07:14,450 --> 00:07:15,450
He's a comrade.

81
00:07:15,870 --> 00:07:18,090
And I'll put my life on the line to help
him.

82
00:07:18,091 --> 00:07:20,190
That's the way of our village.

83
00:07:58,080 --> 00:08:00,740
Wake up before it's too late!

84
00:08:01,580 --> 00:08:06,760
If I'd stayed with comrades like you,
I'd never have gotten this strong.

85
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:10,860
Now I'm going to where Orochimaru is.

86
00:08:13,080 --> 00:08:14,980
Are you out of your mind?!

87
00:08:14,981 --> 00:08:16,895
Orochimaru killed the
Third Hokage and did

88
00:08:16,896 --> 00:08:19,040
everything he could to
destroy the Leaf Village!

89
00:08:19,320 --> 00:08:20,991
Whatever it is that
you're expecting from him,

90
00:08:20,992 --> 00:08:23,501
you think he's going to
give it to you for free?!

91
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:26,900
All he wants is to use your body like a
new suit of clothes!

92
00:08:27,760 --> 00:08:29,300
There'll be nothing of you left!

93
00:08:29,580 --> 00:08:31,200
You'll never get out of there alive!

94
00:08:31,640 --> 00:08:36,240
You think I'll stand by and just let you
throw away your entire life?!

95
00:08:36,241 --> 00:08:38,380
None of that matters now.

96
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:44,620
The only thing that matters to me is
achieving my goal.

97
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:52,300
If you insist on getting in my way,
well, then it can't be helped.

98
00:08:54,580 --> 00:08:56,990
Well, if you aren't
going to listen to reason,

99
00:08:56,991 --> 00:08:59,941
then I'll do this by
force if I have to!

100
00:09:04,400 --> 00:09:07,340
What have you got to laugh about?!

101
00:09:07,341 --> 00:09:10,100
I remember you laughing the last time we
met.

102
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:12,900
The last time?

103
00:09:13,420 --> 00:09:17,160
Remember how thrilled you were at the
thought of beating me to a bloody pulp?

104
00:09:20,020 --> 00:09:21,340
I didn't mean...

105
00:09:23,860 --> 00:09:27,420
I never really wanted that kind of fight!

106
00:09:29,640 --> 00:09:32,660
Even now, I still don't!

107
00:09:34,220 --> 00:09:36,760
I couldn't give a damn what you want.

108
00:10:08,060 --> 00:10:09,780
I'm not going to let you get away with
this!

109
00:10:13,850 --> 00:10:15,190
What is it?

110
00:10:16,030 --> 00:10:18,190
This sudden burst of power...

111
00:10:33,810 --> 00:10:41,530
If that's what I'm capable of now,
wait till I unseal this curse mark.

112
00:10:43,450 --> 00:10:45,030
Imagine the power!

113
00:11:01,270 --> 00:11:03,790
I have woken up, don't you see?

114
00:11:04,950 --> 00:11:09,170
That guy who dreamed of a happy future
full of peace and friendship.

115
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:24,300
He was the one who was asleep.

116
00:11:24,301 --> 00:11:26,800
That's why I left the village.

117
00:11:27,680 --> 00:11:29,800
That's why I've gone in search of power.

118
00:11:30,660 --> 00:11:32,940
It's not the future I dream of anymore.

119
00:11:34,540 --> 00:11:36,000
Only the past.

120
00:11:38,700 --> 00:11:40,780
That's where my dream lies.

121
00:12:17,130 --> 00:12:18,130
Wow, Itachi!

122
00:12:18,629 --> 00:12:19,820
You nailed every target!

123
00:12:20,310 --> 00:12:22,540
Even the one in the blind spot behind the
rock!

124
00:12:22,930 --> 00:12:23,930
All right!

125
00:12:24,250 --> 00:12:25,560
Now it's my turn!

126
00:12:25,720 --> 00:12:26,460
No, Sasuke.

127
00:12:26,740 --> 00:12:27,740
It's time to go.

128
00:12:30,709 --> 00:12:34,220
What happened to the new shuriken jutsu
you promised to teach me, huh?

129
00:12:34,919 --> 00:12:36,119
It'll have to wait till later.

130
00:12:36,295 --> 00:12:39,360
I have an important mission in the
morning, and I need to prepare for it.

131
00:12:41,560 --> 00:12:42,080
It's time to go.

132
00:12:42,081 --> 00:12:43,580
You're such a big fat liar.

133
00:12:52,645 --> 00:12:53,960
Sorry, Sasuke.

134
00:12:54,969 --> 00:12:56,260
Maybe some other time.

135
00:12:57,769 --> 00:13:00,960
Okay, just watch this!

136
00:13:03,700 --> 00:13:04,300
Hey!

137
00:13:04,640 --> 00:13:05,640
Be careful!

138
00:13:13,300 --> 00:13:16,800
How come the one who twisted his ankle is
the one who's laughing?

139
00:13:18,180 --> 00:13:21,020
Maybe you were just looking for a way to
get out of walking home.

140
00:13:21,430 --> 00:13:22,920
No way, that's not it.

141
00:13:23,714 --> 00:13:25,426
It's just that I can't
stop thinking how I'm

142
00:13:25,427 --> 00:13:28,301
finally going to start at
the academy tomorrow.

143
00:13:35,240 --> 00:13:36,240
What's up?

144
00:13:36,890 --> 00:13:39,230
That building is where father works,
isn't it?

145
00:13:40,830 --> 00:13:41,830
Mm-hmm.

146
00:13:42,030 --> 00:13:44,050
It's headquarters for the Leaf Police
Force.

147
00:13:44,950 --> 00:13:48,502
I was wondering, how
come the crest of the Uchiha

148
00:13:48,503 --> 00:13:51,711
clan is part of the Leaf
Police Force insignia?

149
00:13:52,330 --> 00:13:53,330
Well, what do you know?

150
00:13:53,630 --> 00:13:54,690
You finally noticed.

151
00:13:55,345 --> 00:13:56,345
Of course I did.

152
00:13:56,890 --> 00:13:57,890
Right.

153
00:13:58,015 --> 00:14:00,330
Let me see if I can explain it for you.

154
00:14:01,070 --> 00:14:04,217
It was the Uchiha
clan's earliest ancestors

155
00:14:04,218 --> 00:14:07,431
who established the
police here in the village.

156
00:14:08,449 --> 00:14:12,910
So when they created this symbol for the
organization, they used the family crest.

157
00:14:14,270 --> 00:14:18,710
Since a long time ago, the Uchiha have
always ensured the peace here.

158
00:14:19,445 --> 00:14:23,810
The crest is a testament of our clan's
pride and a way of life centuries old.

159
00:14:25,289 --> 00:14:28,110
Over the years, the Uchiha clan has grown
smaller.

160
00:14:29,189 --> 00:14:32,149
But even now, nearly
all of us are a part of the

161
00:14:32,150 --> 00:14:35,251
force and work to uphold
the peace in this village.

162
00:14:36,414 --> 00:14:39,962
Which is good, because only
the most exceptional of shinobi

163
00:14:39,963 --> 00:14:42,470
can weed out the criminals
hiding among their brethren.

164
00:14:44,910 --> 00:14:46,950
Wow, dad is the coolest.

165
00:14:48,690 --> 00:14:50,530
Are you going to join the force too?

166
00:14:51,430 --> 00:14:53,290
Well, I'm not sure.

167
00:14:53,830 --> 00:14:54,830
Why not?

168
00:14:56,359 --> 00:14:59,670
Boy, when I grow up, I'm definitely going
to enter the police force.

169
00:15:00,290 --> 00:15:02,650
And father's coming to tomorrow's entrance
ceremony.

170
00:15:02,860 --> 00:15:04,790
It's the first step to my dream.

171
00:15:05,230 --> 00:15:06,230
That's right.

172
00:15:10,790 --> 00:15:11,830
You're late, Itachi.

173
00:15:12,509 --> 00:15:13,370
What have you been doing?

174
00:15:13,371 --> 00:15:14,750
Father!

175
00:15:16,189 --> 00:15:17,350
I need to talk to you.

176
00:15:17,950 --> 00:15:18,950
Let's go.

177
00:15:21,909 --> 00:15:23,530
About tomorrow's special mission.

178
00:15:26,059 --> 00:15:27,910
I've decided to go along with you.

179
00:15:28,790 --> 00:15:29,790
Tomorrow?

180
00:15:30,179 --> 00:15:34,216
If you complete tomorrow's
mission, Itachi, your

181
00:15:34,217 --> 00:15:37,390
entrance into Anbu Black
Ops is all but assured.

182
00:15:39,950 --> 00:15:41,510
Do you understand?

183
00:15:43,890 --> 00:15:46,190
You don't have to worry about me out
there.

184
00:15:46,930 --> 00:15:48,370
And more importantly...

185
00:15:51,030 --> 00:15:55,610
Father, you see, tomorrow afternoon is...

186
00:15:55,611 --> 00:15:58,610
This mission tomorrow, it's not just about
you.

187
00:15:59,210 --> 00:16:01,630
Your performance will reflect on our
entire clan.

188
00:16:07,060 --> 00:16:09,940
Actually, I'm going to pass on tomorrow's
mission.

189
00:16:09,941 --> 00:16:12,280
What are you talking about?

190
00:16:12,380 --> 00:16:13,380
That's insanity!

191
00:16:13,920 --> 00:16:15,840
You know how important this is!

192
00:16:16,160 --> 00:16:17,600
You'll do no such thing!

193
00:16:18,240 --> 00:16:19,240
I have to.

194
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:21,360
Tomorrow is Sasuke's entrance ceremony.

195
00:16:23,120 --> 00:16:25,060
Our family has to attend.

196
00:16:25,720 --> 00:16:27,260
It's customary at the academy.

197
00:16:28,320 --> 00:16:31,140
You received a notice, remember?

198
00:16:35,729 --> 00:16:36,860
Alright, I get it.

199
00:16:37,240 --> 00:16:38,660
I'll be at the academy tomorrow.

200
00:16:42,700 --> 00:16:43,840
Your left leg.

201
00:16:44,660 --> 00:16:45,760
Be sure to ice it.

202
00:16:47,780 --> 00:16:48,780
Okay.

203
00:16:53,380 --> 00:16:55,740
My congratulations to all of you.

204
00:16:56,100 --> 00:16:59,980
You have a lot of hard work ahead of you
as you walk the path of the Shinobi.

205
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:02,120
But I expect great things.

206
00:17:02,500 --> 00:17:04,640
I know you will do the Leaf Village proud.

207
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:13,540
Boy, it seems like only yesterday that you
were here for Itachi, huh?

208
00:17:14,099 --> 00:17:15,859
And you're his spitting image.

209
00:17:17,520 --> 00:17:19,880
Thank you for your help with both of my
boys.

210
00:17:20,440 --> 00:17:21,400
Oh, not at all.

211
00:17:21,460 --> 00:17:22,460
It's been a pleasure.

212
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:25,380
That boy of yours is a true prodigy.

213
00:17:25,940 --> 00:17:29,000
There hasn't been another one like him in
the history of the academy.

214
00:17:29,800 --> 00:17:31,400
Please, you're being too kind.

215
00:17:32,440 --> 00:17:33,440
Nonsense.

216
00:17:33,540 --> 00:17:35,920
We expect big things from you as well,
Sasuke.

217
00:17:36,560 --> 00:17:39,500
Become a fine Shinobi, just like your
older brother.

218
00:17:42,160 --> 00:17:43,160
Yes, father.

219
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:49,040
Hey, that's Uchiha, right?

220
00:17:49,400 --> 00:17:50,400
Yeah.

221
00:17:50,480 --> 00:17:52,740
Wow, I wonder if he's a genius too.

222
00:17:53,100 --> 00:17:55,360
Yeah, he has to be.

223
00:17:55,361 --> 00:17:56,361
Huh?

224
00:17:57,360 --> 00:18:00,260
Oh man, I thought recess was never going
to get here.

225
00:18:00,700 --> 00:18:02,620
These classes are such a drag.

226
00:18:02,920 --> 00:18:04,160
Shigemaru, you want some?

227
00:18:04,540 --> 00:18:08,560
Seriously, not every single break has to
be a snack break, you know what I mean?

228
00:18:23,870 --> 00:18:24,870
That's my boy.

229
00:18:25,449 --> 00:18:28,390
You'll go far in the Anbu ranks,
no question about it.

230
00:18:36,475 --> 00:18:37,770
It's still not good enough.

231
00:18:38,254 --> 00:18:39,330
I have to do better.

232
00:18:43,810 --> 00:18:46,050
Sasuke, this is your day off, dear.

233
00:18:46,190 --> 00:18:47,930
You need to give your body some rest.

234
00:18:48,130 --> 00:18:48,530
Ow!

235
00:18:48,804 --> 00:18:51,390
You don't have to push yourself so hard.

236
00:18:51,764 --> 00:18:56,510
I know, but they say big brother graduated
from the academy in just a year.

237
00:18:57,294 --> 00:18:58,850
Times have changed, sweetheart.

238
00:18:59,809 --> 00:19:04,010
And your brother is... special.

239
00:19:07,199 --> 00:19:10,090
Alright, these are your report cards for
the first term.

240
00:19:23,099 --> 00:19:26,640
Keep excelling like this and you'll be
just like your brother in no time.

241
00:19:38,260 --> 00:19:43,320
Father, I wanted you to say, that's my
boy, to me.

242
00:19:46,665 --> 00:19:47,665
Come again?

243
00:19:48,129 --> 00:19:50,460
What do you mean you can't participate in
the assembly?

244
00:19:52,669 --> 00:19:55,040
I don't really think you understand your
position.

245
00:19:58,889 --> 00:20:00,580
I'm setting out on a mission tomorrow.

246
00:20:01,159 --> 00:20:02,520
It's the middle of the night.

247
00:20:02,710 --> 00:20:04,380
Why are they up with the lights off?

248
00:20:05,079 --> 00:20:06,300
What are you talking about?

249
00:20:07,969 --> 00:20:08,969
I can't tell you.

250
00:20:09,929 --> 00:20:11,040
The mission is covert.

251
00:20:14,809 --> 00:20:21,201
Itachi, you also serve as the Uchiha clan's
pipeline to the village nerve center.

252
00:20:21,874 --> 00:20:23,100
You know that, don't you?

253
00:20:24,420 --> 00:20:25,420
Yes.

254
00:20:26,469 --> 00:20:28,380
Well, make sure you don't forget it.

255
00:20:28,669 --> 00:20:30,740
You will be at that meeting tomorrow.

256
00:20:33,390 --> 00:20:34,390
Sasuke.

257
00:20:36,119 --> 00:20:38,000
Use the bathroom and go to sleep.

258
00:20:39,235 --> 00:20:39,900
Okay.

259
00:20:39,901 --> 00:20:43,560
What are you doing roaming the house at
this hour?

260
00:20:43,740 --> 00:20:44,740
Get to bed!

261
00:20:47,040 --> 00:20:48,320
Yes, sir.

262
00:20:53,700 --> 00:20:56,040
Father only cares about you, Itachi.

263
00:20:58,220 --> 00:21:00,160
You probably hate me, huh?

264
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:04,040
It's alright.

265
00:21:05,120 --> 00:21:06,920
People often think ill of Shinobi.

266
00:21:08,100 --> 00:21:09,100
It's only logical.

267
00:21:10,160 --> 00:21:11,580
That's not how I feel.

268
00:21:14,179 --> 00:21:15,180
He's right, though.

269
00:21:16,020 --> 00:21:19,280
I do... I do feel that way.

270
00:21:21,880 --> 00:21:24,660
Being the best isn't all it's cracked up
to be.

271
00:21:25,204 --> 00:21:28,700
When you have power, you become arrogant
and isolated from the world.

272
00:21:29,214 --> 00:21:32,500
No matter how coveted and sought after you
are in the beginning.

273
00:21:33,400 --> 00:21:36,800
But with us, it's different, because you
and I are flesh and blood.

274
00:21:37,789 --> 00:21:39,964
I'm always going to
be there for you, even if

275
00:21:39,965 --> 00:21:42,741
it's only as an obstacle
for you to overcome.

276
00:21:43,944 --> 00:21:45,740
Even if you do hate me.

277
00:21:46,875 --> 00:21:48,500
That's what big brothers are for.

278
00:21:49,439 --> 00:21:50,540
Is Itachi in there?

279
00:21:50,880 --> 00:21:51,880
We need to talk!

280
00:21:52,024 --> 00:21:53,024
Get out here!

281
00:21:57,689 --> 00:21:58,770
What's going on?

282
00:21:59,119 --> 00:22:00,239
What are you all doing here?

283
00:22:00,539 --> 00:22:03,390
There were two people who didn't show up
at yesterday's assembly.

284
00:22:04,374 --> 00:22:06,430
Do you want to tell me why you weren't
there?

285
00:22:08,259 --> 00:22:12,430
The meeting Father was talking about last
night... He didn't go after all.

286
00:22:13,249 --> 00:22:15,090
You're in the Anbu Black Ops now.

287
00:22:15,180 --> 00:22:17,770
I know full well you can be called away at
the drop of a hat.

288
00:22:18,489 --> 00:22:19,899
And that's the case
your father was trying

289
00:22:19,900 --> 00:22:22,731
to make when we asked
why you weren't there.

290
00:22:22,939 --> 00:22:23,990
But we're not your father.

291
00:22:24,309 --> 00:22:26,650
You won't be getting any special treatment
from us.

292
00:22:27,970 --> 00:22:28,970
I understand.

293
00:22:29,879 --> 00:22:31,159
I should have been more careful.

294
00:22:32,274 --> 00:22:33,550
Will that be all, then, gentlemen?

295
00:22:33,551 --> 00:22:35,250
Sure thing.

296
00:22:35,894 --> 00:22:37,070
But you know what?

297
00:22:37,574 --> 00:22:39,950
Before we go, there's just one other
thing.

298
00:22:41,779 --> 00:22:47,510
Do you know anything about Shisui Uchiha
ending his life in Nagano River?

299
00:22:48,409 --> 00:22:49,550
Ending his life?

300
00:22:49,750 --> 00:22:53,250
Shisui was the other guy who never turned
up at the assembly yesterday.

301
00:22:53,930 --> 00:22:54,930
It's funny.

302
00:22:55,270 --> 00:22:58,830
If I remember correctly, you kind of
looked up to him like an older brother,

303
00:22:59,170 --> 00:22:59,710
didn't you?

304
00:22:59,711 --> 00:23:01,630
How terrible.

305
00:23:02,590 --> 00:23:04,830
Forgive me, I haven't seen him at all
recently.

306
00:23:05,970 --> 00:23:07,150
What a tragedy.

307
00:23:08,110 --> 00:23:08,410
Yeah.

308
00:23:08,850 --> 00:23:11,468
Well, at this point, the police
force sees no other choice

309
00:23:11,469 --> 00:23:14,010
but to launch an all-out
investigation into the matter.

310
00:23:14,470 --> 00:23:15,470
Investigation?

311
00:23:17,270 --> 00:23:19,550
This is a note Shisui left behind.

312
00:23:20,190 --> 00:23:21,710
We've already had it analyzed.

313
00:23:22,670 --> 00:23:24,750
There's no question this is his
handwriting.

314
00:23:25,610 --> 00:23:28,610
But if it wasn't homicide, why the
investigation?

315
00:23:29,710 --> 00:23:31,453
It would be no great
feat for someone who

316
00:23:31,454 --> 00:23:34,051
possesses Sharingan
to copy his handwriting.

317
00:23:37,550 --> 00:23:39,870
The most talented of all our clan.

318
00:23:40,430 --> 00:23:44,630
Feared as Shisui the Teleporter,
he was a man who would do anything,

319
00:23:44,950 --> 00:23:47,650
take any mission, if it was for the good
of the clan.

320
00:23:48,390 --> 00:23:52,170
Hard to imagine a man like that ending his
life, don't you think?

321
00:23:52,910 --> 00:23:57,550
You shouldn't judge people by their
appearance, or by your own preconceptions.

322
00:23:58,970 --> 00:24:01,070
We'll leave that with you for the time
being.

323
00:24:01,490 --> 00:24:03,654
Take it to Anbu Black
Ops, and put in a request

324
00:24:03,655 --> 00:24:06,311
for them to start snipping
around on this as well.

325
00:24:07,650 --> 00:24:08,650
Understood.

326
00:24:10,099 --> 00:24:12,270
Let's just hope we get a lead on this
soon.

327
00:24:12,410 --> 00:24:16,370
By the way, we have our own connections
inside of Anbu Black Ops.

328
00:24:17,139 --> 00:24:21,030
You try and sweep this investigation under
the rug, and we're gonna know about it.

329
00:24:24,250 --> 00:24:26,490
Why don't you just come out and say it?

330
00:24:29,390 --> 00:24:32,030
You believe I had a hand in this,
don't you?

331
00:24:32,590 --> 00:24:34,770
Yeah, that's right, little punk.

332
00:24:35,510 --> 00:24:36,510
Listen, Itachi.

333
00:24:36,690 --> 00:24:42,271
If I find you betrayed this clan, I want
you to know, you'll pay for your wrongs.

334
00:24:50,110 --> 00:24:57,091
Like I said before, appearances and
preconceptions aren't going to tell you anything.

335
00:24:57,550 --> 00:25:01,750
For instance, you've made the mistake of
assuming I'm a patient man.

336
00:25:02,450 --> 00:25:04,010
The clan, the clan.

337
00:25:04,570 --> 00:25:10,510
You overestimate your own abilities,
with no idea of the depth of my own.

338
00:25:11,110 --> 00:25:14,030
And look at you now, groveling in the
dirt.

339
00:25:14,630 --> 00:25:16,610
I've never seen him like this before.

340
00:25:17,510 --> 00:25:19,350
The strangeness of your behavior.

341
00:25:20,230 --> 00:25:23,790
Half a year into your time at Anbu,
it was impossible to overlook.

342
00:25:24,730 --> 00:25:27,790
What the heck are you playing at,
you filthy little wretch?

343
00:25:28,410 --> 00:25:30,110
Obsessed with the organization.

344
00:25:30,830 --> 00:25:32,170
Obsessed with the clan.

345
00:25:32,690 --> 00:25:34,190
Obsessed with our lineage.

346
00:25:35,010 --> 00:25:40,010
A worthless compulsion that enslaves us,
and limits our capabilities.

347
00:25:40,810 --> 00:25:43,830
Leading us to fear what you don't
understand.

348
00:25:44,850 --> 00:25:45,850
Stop it, Itachi!

349
00:25:47,349 --> 00:25:49,090
What on earth is the matter with you?

350
00:25:49,614 --> 00:25:52,350
Itachi, you've been strange lately.

351
00:25:55,195 --> 00:25:56,195
Huh?

352
00:26:04,320 --> 00:26:05,760
I've had enough.

353
00:26:06,400 --> 00:26:09,320
There's no hope left for this pathetic
clan.

354
00:26:10,920 --> 00:26:13,500
The people of this clan are all the same.

355
00:26:13,960 --> 00:26:17,240
You focus on the trivial and lose sight of
what's most important.

356
00:26:18,120 --> 00:26:21,240
Change is impossible in this fog of
ignorance.

357
00:26:21,880 --> 00:26:24,720
How can we evolve when regulation is all
we know?

358
00:26:24,721 --> 00:26:26,160
Such arrogance!

359
00:26:26,460 --> 00:26:27,460
That's enough!

360
00:26:28,040 --> 00:26:31,960
If I hear one more word of this nonsense,
I'll have you thrown behind bars!

361
00:26:32,380 --> 00:26:34,280
Brother, why?

362
00:26:35,440 --> 00:26:37,300
Well, what's it gonna be?

363
00:26:37,600 --> 00:26:39,160
I can't take this anymore.

364
00:26:39,740 --> 00:26:41,840
Please sir, just give me the order!

365
00:26:42,264 --> 00:26:44,780
Big brother, you have to stop!

366
00:26:50,649 --> 00:26:56,061
I'm not the one who killed Shisui, but I
apologize for the words I have spoken.

367
00:26:56,579 --> 00:26:57,840
I'm truly sorry.

368
00:27:03,729 --> 00:27:08,781
He's been pretty tired lately, after his
years in missions from the Anbu Black Ops.

369
00:27:08,965 --> 00:27:09,965
But Captain!

370
00:27:10,219 --> 00:27:12,740
Anbu are under the direct control of the
Hokage.

371
00:27:13,459 --> 00:27:17,160
Even if you wanted to arrest one of them,
you would need to get a warrant first.

372
00:27:18,819 --> 00:27:21,120
I take full responsibility for him.

373
00:27:22,645 --> 00:27:23,645
You've my word.

374
00:27:27,089 --> 00:27:29,720
Very well, sir.

375
00:27:49,449 --> 00:27:50,449
What did it mean?

376
00:27:51,739 --> 00:27:57,530
That look in my brother's eyes...
That was no ordinary Sharingan.

377
00:28:00,509 --> 00:28:04,560
And ever since, even
though that was a while ago,

378
00:28:04,561 --> 00:28:08,570
there's been something
wrong between him and father.

379
00:28:40,339 --> 00:28:42,600
Good morning to you, father.

380
00:28:43,200 --> 00:28:44,200
Ah, yes.

381
00:28:44,480 --> 00:28:45,480
Good morning.

382
00:28:46,879 --> 00:28:48,480
How's everything going at the academy?

383
00:28:51,839 --> 00:28:56,800
Some of the lessons are a little boring,
but I'm always top of my class.

384
00:28:59,279 --> 00:29:00,279
Fire style!

385
00:29:00,610 --> 00:29:01,620
Fireball jutsu!

386
00:29:08,640 --> 00:29:09,640
Whoa!

387
00:29:11,054 --> 00:29:13,100
This is the key jutsu of our clan.

388
00:29:13,360 --> 00:29:15,700
Now I've already shown you all the hand
signs.

389
00:29:16,264 --> 00:29:20,200
The next step is to build up your chakra
and focus it to a point in your chest,

390
00:29:20,380 --> 00:29:22,540
then force it up through the throat and
out the mouth.

391
00:29:23,549 --> 00:29:24,600
Now you try it.

392
00:29:24,900 --> 00:29:25,900
Right!

393
00:29:28,699 --> 00:29:31,220
Father's actually teaching me the jutsu
himself.

394
00:29:32,879 --> 00:29:36,340
He's finally giving me a chance to show
that I matter too.

395
00:29:36,341 --> 00:29:39,420
I can't disappoint him.

396
00:29:41,280 --> 00:29:41,780
Fire style!

397
00:29:42,160 --> 00:29:43,300
Fireball jutsu!

398
00:29:50,209 --> 00:29:52,140
Why did I think you would be like Itachi?

399
00:29:54,724 --> 00:29:55,724
It's too soon.

400
00:29:55,885 --> 00:29:56,980
They're not ready yet.

401
00:29:59,280 --> 00:30:02,394
A member of the Uchiha
clan is not recognized as

402
00:30:02,395 --> 00:30:05,260
full-fledged until they
can use the fire style.

403
00:30:08,840 --> 00:30:14,340
The Uchiha crest represents the fan that
rouses the flame of our will.

404
00:30:17,780 --> 00:30:19,220
Fire style!

405
00:30:19,560 --> 00:30:20,590
Fireball jutsu!

406
00:30:28,140 --> 00:30:29,580
Fire style!

407
00:30:29,880 --> 00:30:31,260
Fireball jutsu!

408
00:30:39,150 --> 00:30:41,500
Okay, today for sure.

409
00:30:42,700 --> 00:30:43,760
Fire style!

410
00:30:44,240 --> 00:30:45,360
Fireball jutsu!

411
00:30:50,020 --> 00:30:51,020
Sasuke?

412
00:30:52,430 --> 00:30:53,430
Hold on a minute.

413
00:30:54,080 --> 00:30:55,080
What is it?

414
00:30:59,359 --> 00:31:00,760
What's that for?

415
00:31:01,859 --> 00:31:03,500
No, no, don't go yet.

416
00:31:05,879 --> 00:31:07,580
There, that should help.

417
00:31:10,534 --> 00:31:11,900
Hey, mom?

418
00:31:14,540 --> 00:31:17,120
No, it's nothing.

419
00:31:17,820 --> 00:31:18,820
You sure?

420
00:31:39,800 --> 00:31:41,520
I'm just getting started.

421
00:31:42,600 --> 00:31:44,900
Okay, here we go.

422
00:31:45,800 --> 00:31:46,800
Fire style!

423
00:31:47,160 --> 00:31:48,340
Fireball jutsu!

424
00:31:58,620 --> 00:31:59,620
Father!

425
00:32:03,580 --> 00:32:05,160
Just once more?

426
00:32:06,660 --> 00:32:09,400
Will you come watch me one more time?

427
00:32:09,401 --> 00:32:11,880
I told you it's too soon for you.

428
00:32:12,380 --> 00:32:14,860
I could teach you every day for a week and
it wouldn't help.

429
00:32:15,080 --> 00:32:17,560
No, not teach me.

430
00:32:19,140 --> 00:32:20,140
Watch me.

431
00:32:20,620 --> 00:32:23,360
I'm saying I think I've got the hang of
it, father.

432
00:32:38,880 --> 00:32:40,460
Failure is not an option.

433
00:32:41,380 --> 00:32:42,100
Fire style!

434
00:32:42,340 --> 00:32:43,500
Fireball jutsu!

435
00:33:15,144 --> 00:33:17,520
Now then, that's my boy.

436
00:33:20,100 --> 00:33:21,200
You've done well.

437
00:33:21,960 --> 00:33:24,360
Work hard and you're bound to soar high.

438
00:33:25,220 --> 00:33:27,960
And to bring honor to that crest you wear
on your back.

439
00:33:32,570 --> 00:33:33,570
I will!

440
00:33:34,270 --> 00:33:36,530
From now on, walk your own path.

441
00:33:38,630 --> 00:33:40,630
Not in the footsteps of your brother.

442
00:33:51,159 --> 00:33:52,159
Hey, mom.

443
00:33:55,994 --> 00:34:01,640
I was wondering, about Itachi and me,
what does father really think of us?

444
00:34:03,219 --> 00:34:05,000
What on earth makes you ask that?

445
00:34:06,860 --> 00:34:08,780
It was something he said.

446
00:34:09,550 --> 00:34:13,260
The other day, down on the dock,
father said to me, that's my boy.

447
00:34:14,135 --> 00:34:16,580
That's something he's only ever said to
Itachi.

448
00:34:17,520 --> 00:34:19,920
So it made me really happy to hear it.

449
00:34:20,580 --> 00:34:22,460
Of course, and I'm glad it did.

450
00:34:22,935 --> 00:34:28,360
But then I started to wonder, now that
father and Itachi aren't getting along...

451
00:34:31,515 --> 00:34:36,540
Am I just... someone to replace my older
brother?

452
00:34:39,340 --> 00:34:42,120
Your older brother's your older brother,
and you're you.

453
00:34:42,825 --> 00:34:45,900
But your father has always cared very
deeply about both of you.

454
00:34:46,109 --> 00:34:48,400
He's only thought of Itachi before now!

455
00:34:49,180 --> 00:34:51,453
Well, if it sometimes
seemed that way, it's only

456
00:34:51,454 --> 00:34:54,440
because your father is a
leader of the Uchiha clan.

457
00:34:54,739 --> 00:34:56,480
He has to make sure it's kept safe.

458
00:34:57,250 --> 00:34:58,920
What's that got to do with it?

459
00:34:59,220 --> 00:35:02,320
Your brother is the firstborn,
and he's bigger than you are.

460
00:35:02,589 --> 00:35:04,477
And as the firstborn,
he's going to have to

461
00:35:04,478 --> 00:35:07,241
assume his responsibilities
earlier than you will.

462
00:35:07,680 --> 00:35:12,020
So since it's your father's job to look
after the clan, it's only natural he'd

463
00:35:12,021 --> 00:35:14,520
want to be sure that Itachi's ready to
take on his role.

464
00:35:21,800 --> 00:35:23,460
But I'll let you in on a secret.

465
00:35:24,959 --> 00:35:29,480
When we're alone and no one's around,
the only one he talks about is you.

466
00:35:34,160 --> 00:35:36,280
He has a hard time showing it.

467
00:35:36,560 --> 00:35:37,560
It's how he is.

468
00:35:41,210 --> 00:35:42,210
Big brother!

469
00:35:44,110 --> 00:35:48,790
Do you... think you could help me out with
my shuriken jutsu after school today?

470
00:35:49,920 --> 00:35:50,830
No, I can't.

471
00:35:50,870 --> 00:35:51,870
I'm busy.

472
00:35:52,290 --> 00:35:54,150
Why don't you go ask father to help you?

473
00:35:55,300 --> 00:35:56,300
Aw, come on.

474
00:35:56,590 --> 00:35:59,090
You're better at the shuriken jutsu than
father is.

475
00:36:00,260 --> 00:36:01,810
I mean, even I can see that.

476
00:36:03,150 --> 00:36:06,770
Big brother, why do you always treat me
like such a pest?

477
00:36:21,130 --> 00:36:22,350
I'm sorry, Sasuke.

478
00:36:23,390 --> 00:36:24,550
Some other time, okay?

479
00:36:40,060 --> 00:36:41,690
I don't have time for this today.

480
00:36:44,660 --> 00:36:46,190
You're always doing this to me.

481
00:36:46,350 --> 00:36:49,310
You jab me in the forehead and then say
I'm sorry, Sasuke.

482
00:36:49,810 --> 00:36:51,270
And you never have time.

483
00:36:51,500 --> 00:36:53,030
It's always the same story.

484
00:37:04,180 --> 00:37:05,180
Father?

485
00:37:06,190 --> 00:37:10,760
How come... how come big brother never
pays any attention to me?

486
00:37:13,450 --> 00:37:15,560
Your brother's always been a little
strange, son.

487
00:37:17,380 --> 00:37:21,320
He has a hard time dropping his guard
around other people, letting them in.

488
00:37:22,130 --> 00:37:23,130
What do you mean?

489
00:37:24,540 --> 00:37:25,540
I don't know.

490
00:37:27,490 --> 00:37:28,620
Even I can't read him.

491
00:37:28,759 --> 00:37:29,860
And I'm the boy's father.

492
00:37:31,220 --> 00:37:32,220
That kid.

493
00:37:33,510 --> 00:37:35,420
Okay, here's your lunch, Sasuke.

494
00:37:36,140 --> 00:37:37,908
And as for your shuriken
practice, I can help

495
00:37:37,909 --> 00:37:40,121
you work on it when
you get home if you want.

496
00:37:42,140 --> 00:37:43,320
It's not just practice.

497
00:37:43,689 --> 00:37:44,820
It's actual training.

498
00:37:46,080 --> 00:37:47,080
See you later!

499
00:37:52,279 --> 00:37:53,770
Good morning, Sasuke.

500
00:37:53,950 --> 00:37:55,430
Heading off to school now, are you?

501
00:37:55,690 --> 00:37:56,690
Uh-huh.

502
00:37:57,050 --> 00:37:58,610
I saw your brother earlier.

503
00:37:58,750 --> 00:38:00,330
He's grown into such a man.

504
00:38:00,770 --> 00:38:03,030
He's an excellent shinobi, isn't he?

505
00:38:03,930 --> 00:38:07,650
Graduating the academy at the age of seven
and first in his class.

506
00:38:07,890 --> 00:38:10,130
And he was a chunin at ten, wasn't he?

507
00:38:10,290 --> 00:38:13,070
Yeah, and he could use Sharingan by the
time he was eight.

508
00:38:15,050 --> 00:38:15,930
That's right.

509
00:38:16,010 --> 00:38:17,010
How could I forget?

510
00:38:17,390 --> 00:38:19,910
That boy is the pride of the Uchiha clan.

511
00:38:20,220 --> 00:38:21,430
No doubt about it.

512
00:38:22,150 --> 00:38:23,710
What about you, Sasuke?

513
00:38:23,930 --> 00:38:25,130
How old are you now?

514
00:38:26,634 --> 00:38:29,750
I'm the same age as my brother when he
graduated.

515
00:38:30,790 --> 00:38:31,790
And I'm...

516
00:38:33,650 --> 00:38:35,170
What's the matter, child?

517
00:38:35,350 --> 00:38:35,690
Honey!

518
00:38:36,290 --> 00:38:38,810
Stop talking nonsense to the boy,
will you?

519
00:38:39,285 --> 00:38:40,530
What do you mean, dear?

520
00:38:41,570 --> 00:38:44,713
Sasuke, both you and
Itachi are of the Uchiha

521
00:38:44,714 --> 00:38:47,631
clan, the brightest gem
of the Hidden Leaf Village.

522
00:38:48,170 --> 00:38:49,250
Have faith in yourself.

523
00:38:50,010 --> 00:38:53,450
Someday you'll be an outstanding shinobi,
just like Itachi.

524
00:38:55,850 --> 00:38:56,850
See you later!

525
00:38:57,710 --> 00:38:59,170
Just do your best!

526
00:38:59,450 --> 00:39:01,690
Study hard now and you'll do fine!

527
00:39:11,400 --> 00:39:12,940
I won't lose to him!

528
00:39:26,220 --> 00:39:27,220
I'm so late!

529
00:39:36,300 --> 00:39:38,260
What was that?

530
00:39:38,740 --> 00:39:40,820
I could have sworn there was someone
there.

531
00:39:40,821 --> 00:39:41,821
Huh?

532
00:39:53,580 --> 00:39:57,200
What is going on?

533
00:40:03,520 --> 00:40:05,060
What is happening?

534
00:40:18,980 --> 00:40:20,180
Aunty?

535
00:40:21,500 --> 00:40:22,700
Aunty?

536
00:40:22,701 --> 00:40:23,140
Oh no!

537
00:40:23,620 --> 00:40:24,620
Father and mother!

538
00:40:35,340 --> 00:40:37,020
Somebody's in here!

539
00:40:48,210 --> 00:40:49,210
Move!

540
00:40:50,150 --> 00:40:51,150
Move!

541
00:41:04,880 --> 00:41:05,480
Father!

542
00:41:05,900 --> 00:41:06,900
Mother!

543
00:41:32,640 --> 00:41:33,780
Big brother!

544
00:41:34,260 --> 00:41:35,260
Itachi!

545
00:41:35,560 --> 00:41:41,820
Father and mother are both... I don't...
understand... Who could do all this?

546
00:41:54,100 --> 00:41:55,700
What have you done?

547
00:41:56,460 --> 00:41:57,460
Big brother!

548
00:41:58,180 --> 00:41:59,380
Foolish little brother.

549
00:41:59,649 --> 00:42:00,920
I almost pity you.

550
00:42:07,960 --> 00:42:10,160
Mangekyou Sharingan!

551
00:42:23,320 --> 00:42:27,160
I can't move my legs!

552
00:42:30,920 --> 00:42:31,920
No!

553
00:42:40,520 --> 00:42:41,760
Stop it!

554
00:42:42,100 --> 00:42:43,100
Itachi!

555
00:42:43,360 --> 00:42:45,440
Why are you showing me all this?

556
00:42:48,400 --> 00:42:51,280
Why did you do this, brother?

557
00:42:52,200 --> 00:42:53,200
No!

558
00:42:53,640 --> 00:42:54,640
No!

559
00:43:01,920 --> 00:43:02,440
Aunty!

560
00:43:02,860 --> 00:43:03,860
Uncle!

561
00:43:06,880 --> 00:43:07,920
Father!

562
00:43:08,420 --> 00:43:08,780
Mother!

563
00:43:09,260 --> 00:43:10,700
Stop it, Itachi!

564
00:43:13,060 --> 00:43:14,700
Father and mother!

565
00:43:15,900 --> 00:43:16,900
No!

566
00:43:56,340 --> 00:43:57,220
Why?

567
00:43:57,221 --> 00:43:59,240
Why did you do this?

568
00:44:00,220 --> 00:44:01,280
Itachi, why?

569
00:44:03,900 --> 00:44:06,800
To test the limits of my ability.

570
00:44:08,460 --> 00:44:11,300
To test your ability?

571
00:44:13,380 --> 00:44:15,220
That's why you did this?

572
00:44:18,620 --> 00:44:23,020
You're telling me that was why you
butchered them?

573
00:44:27,600 --> 00:44:29,500
You're out of your mind!

574
00:44:54,290 --> 00:44:55,670
I'm scared.

575
00:44:56,770 --> 00:44:57,770
I'm scared!

576
00:45:10,150 --> 00:45:10,610
Please!

577
00:45:11,070 --> 00:45:12,530
I don't want to die!

578
00:45:12,531 --> 00:45:13,531
Why?

579
00:45:33,730 --> 00:45:34,790
It's a lie.

580
00:45:35,190 --> 00:45:36,650
This isn't like you, big brother.

581
00:45:37,270 --> 00:45:38,090
It can't be.

582
00:45:38,230 --> 00:45:41,650
I have acted like the older brother you
desired for one reason.

583
00:45:42,210 --> 00:45:45,330
Because I wanted to discover how powerful
you were.

584
00:45:46,770 --> 00:45:51,050
I needed to find a worthy opponent to test
the limits of my own abilities.

585
00:45:52,930 --> 00:45:55,130
You have that unique potential.

586
00:45:56,650 --> 00:45:58,370
Now I've made you hate me.

587
00:45:58,970 --> 00:46:01,270
Now you have the desire to defeat me.

588
00:46:01,850 --> 00:46:05,010
Which is exactly why I'm going to allow
you to live.

589
00:46:06,050 --> 00:46:07,050
Don't you see?

590
00:46:07,570 --> 00:46:09,210
It's all for my own benefit.

591
00:46:10,530 --> 00:46:15,130
Like me, you may be one of the few who can
use Mangekyou Sharingan.

592
00:46:18,110 --> 00:46:20,070
But there is a catch.

593
00:46:25,170 --> 00:46:27,710
Take the life of your best friend.

594
00:46:29,450 --> 00:46:30,470
You must kill him.

595
00:46:32,170 --> 00:46:34,670
No, that's a lie.

596
00:46:35,450 --> 00:46:38,570
Kill him, just like I did.

597
00:46:40,270 --> 00:46:42,970
Itachi, you killed Shisui.

598
00:46:44,230 --> 00:46:45,230
I did.

599
00:46:45,930 --> 00:46:48,610
How else do you think I obtained these
powers?

600
00:46:50,090 --> 00:46:56,410
In the main hall of Nakano Shrine,
underneath the seventh tatami mat from the

601
00:46:56,411 --> 00:47:00,070
far right, is the clan's secret gathering
place.

602
00:47:01,190 --> 00:47:07,250
There you will find a secret document,
an explanation of the Uchiha clan's jutsu.

603
00:47:08,350 --> 00:47:11,450
It tells of the visual jutsu's true
purpose.

604
00:47:12,630 --> 00:47:13,630
What?

605
00:47:13,830 --> 00:47:15,230
The true purpose?

606
00:47:16,050 --> 00:47:20,083
If you discover how to
activate it, you will be the third

607
00:47:20,084 --> 00:47:25,190
person to obtain the Mangekyou
Sharingan, including myself.

608
00:47:26,310 --> 00:47:31,910
To ensure that happens, that's enough
reason to let you live.

609
00:47:32,990 --> 00:47:34,950
Well, that's all.

610
00:47:36,150 --> 00:47:37,470
Oh, don't worry.

611
00:47:37,950 --> 00:47:39,050
You're not worth killing.

612
00:47:40,030 --> 00:47:46,390
My foolish little brother, if you wish to
kill me one day, in hate and revenge,

613
00:47:47,330 --> 00:47:52,310
surviving in such an unsightly manner as
this, by all means flee.

614
00:47:53,290 --> 00:47:54,870
Cling to your wretched life.

615
00:47:55,690 --> 00:48:01,850
And then, one day, when you possess the
same eyes, come back and face me.

616
00:48:09,050 --> 00:48:10,050
Huh?

617
00:48:21,060 --> 00:48:22,880
No, wait!

618
00:49:15,154 --> 00:49:16,750
Yeah, that's what I heard too.

619
00:49:17,255 --> 00:49:20,070
That boy was the only one who survived the
massacre.

620
00:49:20,071 --> 00:49:22,630
Someone said they think he has an older
brother.

621
00:49:22,960 --> 00:49:23,960
Is that right?

622
00:49:25,290 --> 00:49:26,290
Yeah, he does.

623
00:49:26,550 --> 00:49:28,630
But no one knows where he is right now.

624
00:49:31,120 --> 00:49:32,790
I can't believe it.

625
00:49:33,030 --> 00:49:36,070
That the elite Uchiha clan could just
be...

626
00:49:57,490 --> 00:49:58,860
Hello there, Sasuke.

627
00:49:59,235 --> 00:50:01,480
What tasty treats can I get for you today?

628
00:50:01,481 --> 00:50:02,481
Huh?

629
00:50:07,410 --> 00:50:08,410
In

630
00:50:17,765 --> 00:50:24,640
the main hall of Nakano Shrine,
underneath the seventh tatami mat on the

631
00:50:24,641 --> 00:50:28,220
far right, is the clan's secret gathering
place.

632
00:50:34,625 --> 00:50:35,700
I see now.

633
00:50:36,890 --> 00:50:38,380
So that's what it all means.

634
00:50:44,880 --> 00:50:46,440
What do you say, Shikamaru?

635
00:50:46,740 --> 00:50:48,920
Wanna go to the candy store after school?

636
00:50:49,100 --> 00:50:49,300
Huh?

637
00:50:49,620 --> 00:50:50,620
No way!

638
00:50:50,940 --> 00:50:54,080
You can get away with that stuff cause
your mom's nice.

639
00:50:54,320 --> 00:50:56,872
But if my mother found
out I didn't come straight

640
00:50:56,873 --> 00:50:59,921
home, man, I'd be in
some serious trouble.

641
00:51:00,880 --> 00:51:01,880
Did you hear?

642
00:51:01,960 --> 00:51:04,600
Apparently the entire Uchiha clan was
murdered.

643
00:51:05,530 --> 00:51:07,640
Yeah, that's what my dad was telling me.

644
00:51:08,544 --> 00:51:11,580
They say that Sasuke is the only one who
survived.

645
00:51:27,374 --> 00:51:30,110
Now then, that's my boy.

646
00:51:30,890 --> 00:51:34,950
When we're alone and no one's around,
the only one he talks about is you.

647
00:51:41,140 --> 00:51:46,480
I wish I knew what kinds of things he said
to her about me.

648
00:51:57,980 --> 00:52:02,040
If you wish to kill me one day,
in hate and revenge...

649
00:52:05,540 --> 00:52:06,540
Brother!

650
00:52:09,000 --> 00:52:15,301
No matter what darkness may await me, if it
means killing you, I will meet it head on.

651
00:52:15,660 --> 00:52:19,000
And whatever happens, I will get that
power.

652
00:52:19,960 --> 00:52:23,500
From this point on, I am an Avenger.

653
00:52:26,960 --> 00:52:30,180
Wherever he is, Sasuke is in the darkness.

654
00:52:30,181 --> 00:52:34,440
If we all stay put here, we won't be able
to catch up with him.

655
00:52:57,500 --> 00:52:59,660
Eiji, it's just like you said.

656
00:53:00,580 --> 00:53:03,360
Sasuke is in the depths of darkness right
now.

657
00:53:03,361 --> 00:53:05,740
He really wants to kill me.

658
00:53:06,480 --> 00:53:08,080
I can't believe it.

659
00:53:12,600 --> 00:53:14,340
What am I to you now?

660
00:53:14,800 --> 00:53:18,800
We were comrades, or have you just
forgotten all about that?

661
00:53:19,560 --> 00:53:23,054
Are you telling me that all
the things we did together

662
00:53:23,055 --> 00:53:26,080
in Squad 7 mean absolutely
nothing to you now?

663
00:53:26,980 --> 00:53:28,880
They weren't meaningless.

664
00:53:29,500 --> 00:53:31,400
One thing was worthwhile.

665
00:53:32,340 --> 00:53:33,340
Our friendship.

666
00:53:34,200 --> 00:53:36,120
We became best friends.

667
00:53:37,260 --> 00:53:39,720
We became best friends?

668
00:53:40,440 --> 00:53:42,180
Then why are we fighting?

669
00:53:42,600 --> 00:53:43,920
I just told you.

670
00:53:45,420 --> 00:53:50,580
Because we're friends, there's far more
meaning in destroying you.

671
00:53:56,080 --> 00:53:58,140
I can't understand that.

672
00:53:58,780 --> 00:54:03,060
But what I know is that for some reason,
you want to destroy me.

673
00:54:03,840 --> 00:54:04,840
Right, Sasuke?

674
00:54:14,800 --> 00:54:17,940
I know I said this already, but...

675
00:54:18,520 --> 00:54:20,280
Be honest with yourself.

676
00:54:20,480 --> 00:54:22,280
You've been waiting for this moment too.

677
00:54:23,440 --> 00:54:25,940
Kakashi and Sakura aren't here now.

678
00:54:27,260 --> 00:54:29,940
Nobody's gonna stop us like the last time.

679
00:54:34,660 --> 00:54:35,940
You lousy...

680
00:54:37,660 --> 00:54:38,660
Midori!

681
00:54:45,360 --> 00:54:46,460
You idiot!

682
00:54:47,980 --> 00:54:49,720
Right back at ya, pal!

683
00:54:50,120 --> 00:54:55,000
I'll beat you into oblivion if that's what
it's gonna take to bring you back home!

684
00:54:55,940 --> 00:54:58,000
Shadow Clone Jutsu!

685
00:55:09,780 --> 00:55:10,940
Rasengan!

686
00:55:24,630 --> 00:55:25,830
He

687
00:55:58,300 --> 00:56:02,100
was able to counter my Chidori at its full
power.

688
00:56:06,040 --> 00:56:07,040
Naruto...

689
00:56:09,340 --> 00:56:10,340
Naruto...

690
00:56:15,240 --> 00:56:19,880
So, looks like you're good for two bursts.

691
00:56:20,360 --> 00:56:21,540
That's about your limit.

692
00:56:23,440 --> 00:56:27,760
What would happen if I tried to use it
more than twice?

693
00:56:30,480 --> 00:56:33,300
Well, for one thing, it wouldn't work.

694
00:56:33,780 --> 00:56:35,000
But remember this.

695
00:56:35,001 --> 00:56:39,322
If you try to force a Jutsu,
not only will it not work,

696
00:56:39,323 --> 00:56:43,260
but the attempt can drain
your chakra to absolute zero.

697
00:56:44,220 --> 00:56:46,520
Worst case scenario, you die.

698
00:56:46,880 --> 00:56:48,660
I can't waste another blow.

699
00:56:49,520 --> 00:56:50,520
It would be pointless.

700
00:56:51,430 --> 00:56:53,940
All we'll do is cancel each other out
again.

701
00:56:56,780 --> 00:56:57,780
That's it.

702
00:56:58,720 --> 00:57:00,720
There's no mistaking it now.

703
00:57:05,990 --> 00:57:09,930
You're dead serious about this,
aren't you?

704
00:57:20,120 --> 00:57:23,180
You really mean to...

705
00:57:24,320 --> 00:57:28,220
I'll have to use some of my faster Jutsu
to create an opening.

706
00:57:29,220 --> 00:57:33,000
And then... I'll hit him with Chidori.

707
00:57:37,760 --> 00:57:38,760
Sasuke...

708
00:57:44,180 --> 00:57:46,920
Sasuke... You know what
they say, don't you, Naruto?

709
00:57:48,500 --> 00:57:51,839
When two shinobi are
powerful enough, they are able to

710
00:57:51,840 --> 00:57:55,220
read each other's thoughts
simply by an exchange of fists.

711
00:57:56,860 --> 00:58:00,960
Tell me, do you know my thoughts?

712
00:58:02,220 --> 00:58:05,060
Can you tell what's on my mind?

713
00:58:07,260 --> 00:58:08,700
Fire Style!

714
00:58:09,140 --> 00:58:10,920
Phoenix Flower Jutsu!

715
00:58:25,700 --> 00:58:28,440
Sasuke... I always knew that you were
alone.

716
00:58:29,800 --> 00:58:37,781
At first, when I realized there was someone
else like me around, I was relieved.

717
00:58:41,600 --> 00:58:43,240
And happy, too.

718
00:58:44,260 --> 00:58:47,780
To tell the truth, I wanted to approach
you right off the bat.

719
00:58:53,460 --> 00:58:56,520
But... I just couldn't work up the nerve.

720
00:59:00,660 --> 00:59:03,080
You were always able to do everything.

721
00:59:04,000 --> 00:59:06,540
And everyone was always fawning over you.

722
00:59:15,380 --> 00:59:17,620
But... You were
so far ahead of me.

723
00:59:18,540 --> 00:59:20,520
And I didn't want to admit it.

724
00:59:21,000 --> 00:59:23,200
So I started to see you as my rival.

725
00:59:26,900 --> 00:59:28,940
I didn't want to lose to you.

726
00:59:29,820 --> 00:59:34,500
And with everyone calling me a loser,
it just made things worse.

727
00:59:36,540 --> 00:59:41,520
Even when we became Squad Seven,
I never stopped feeling that way.

728
00:59:42,420 --> 00:59:43,560
I was stubborn.

729
00:59:44,380 --> 00:59:47,060
And I couldn't express what I really felt.

730
00:59:49,580 --> 00:59:53,960
The truth was, I really just wanted to be
like you.

731
00:59:55,340 --> 00:59:58,960
You were... You were everything I aspired
to.

732
01:00:00,040 --> 01:00:01,540
That's why...

733
01:00:02,840 --> 01:00:05,740
You're one of the ones I want to fight the
most.

734
01:00:06,840 --> 01:00:10,220
You have no idea how happy you made me
that day.

735
01:00:12,080 --> 01:00:17,000
It was the first time you ever said
anything acknowledging me.

736
01:00:19,200 --> 01:00:23,140
You and I don't need to come to blows to
know each other's thoughts anyway.

737
01:00:24,580 --> 01:00:29,060
Ever since that day, even though we've
never said it.

738
01:00:33,910 --> 01:00:35,730
There's no question.

739
01:00:37,230 --> 01:00:39,690
You're my closest friend.

740
01:00:40,410 --> 01:00:45,070
But now, you're seriously trying to take
me out.

741
01:00:46,290 --> 01:00:52,650
And I don't really know if you meant to be
said before or not.

742
01:00:56,390 --> 01:00:58,970
Maybe I was the only one.

743
01:00:59,970 --> 01:01:04,790
Who thought... Who thought that we were
friends?

744
01:01:07,530 --> 01:01:10,350
I told you it's too late!

745
01:01:16,930 --> 01:01:23,680
If that's the case, then...

746
01:01:25,820 --> 01:01:28,280
Then how stupid am I?

747
01:01:35,440 --> 01:01:37,860
I don't know why.

748
01:01:39,520 --> 01:01:41,600
I don't know why.

749
01:01:46,960 --> 01:01:47,960
But...

750
01:01:49,380 --> 01:01:51,580
But I...

751
01:01:54,220 --> 01:01:58,620
I just can't bear the thought...

752
01:02:00,740 --> 01:02:05,880
Of seeing you taken away by someone like
Orochimaru!

753
01:02:13,910 --> 01:02:18,290
You managed to divert the blow with your
left hand at the last second.

754
01:02:18,810 --> 01:02:21,110
But in the end, it doesn't matter,
does it?

755
01:02:23,230 --> 01:02:24,830
You're finished anyway.

756
01:02:25,530 --> 01:02:28,710
You can forget all about hand signs and
that jutsu of yours.

757
01:02:32,600 --> 01:02:34,060
This is the end.

758
01:03:57,170 --> 01:03:57,770
You're finished.

759
01:03:57,771 --> 01:03:58,870
What is this power?

760
01:04:00,050 --> 01:04:01,950
And what was that red chakra?

761
01:04:03,030 --> 01:04:05,010
Is he some kind of monster?

762
01:04:09,730 --> 01:04:11,050
I've had enough of this.

763
01:04:11,250 --> 01:04:12,450
What the heck are you?

764
01:04:13,710 --> 01:04:15,130
I'm your friend!

765
01:04:16,050 --> 01:04:18,050
That's why I'm telling you...

766
01:04:18,051 --> 01:04:21,150
I'm not going to let the likes of
Orochimaru get a hold of you!

767
01:04:21,770 --> 01:04:26,450
And if you won't listen to reason,
then... I'll break every bone in your body!

768
01:05:13,160 --> 01:05:14,660
Fire Style!

769
01:05:14,820 --> 01:05:15,980
Fireball Jutsu!

770
01:05:58,455 --> 01:05:59,800
Now let's go!

771
01:06:00,240 --> 01:06:01,020
Enough is enough!

772
01:06:01,160 --> 01:06:02,440
Snap out of it already!

773
01:06:05,170 --> 01:06:08,840
If you don't come to your senses,
then I'm just going to have to break all

774
01:06:08,841 --> 01:06:10,980
your bones and drag you back to the
village!

775
01:06:11,410 --> 01:06:12,900
So get up, Sasuke!

776
01:06:15,509 --> 01:06:17,700
Just shut up for once.

777
01:06:18,549 --> 01:06:20,640
What the heck do you know about it?

778
01:06:21,220 --> 01:06:24,800
It's not like you ever had a family in the
first place!

779
01:06:26,320 --> 01:06:28,740
You were on your own right from the
beginning!

780
01:06:29,360 --> 01:06:32,240
What makes you think you know anything
about it, huh?!

781
01:06:35,180 --> 01:06:38,240
I'm suffering now because I had those
ties.

782
01:06:38,880 --> 01:06:44,260
How on earth could you possibly understand
what it feels like to lose all that?!

783
01:07:10,660 --> 01:07:11,660
It's true.

784
01:07:12,080 --> 01:07:16,140
I have no idea what it's like having
parents or a brother.

785
01:07:18,640 --> 01:07:20,500
But... It's my treat today.

786
01:07:20,780 --> 01:07:21,880
Eat as much as you want.

787
01:07:22,140 --> 01:07:23,140
Alright!

788
01:07:23,660 --> 01:07:23,980
Why?!

789
01:07:24,300 --> 01:07:28,000
Whenever I'm with Iruka-sensei,
I wonder...

790
01:07:28,820 --> 01:07:30,520
DOWN THE HATCH!

791
01:07:31,040 --> 01:07:33,420
First of all, a ninja's gotta have
sustenance!

792
01:07:36,620 --> 01:07:37,840
Hey, take it easy.

793
01:07:37,920 --> 01:07:39,320
Don't whoop it down so fast.

794
01:07:41,400 --> 01:07:45,460
I wonder if that's what it feels like to
have a father.

795
01:07:47,640 --> 01:07:49,700
And when I'm with you...

796
01:07:50,740 --> 01:07:53,000
Whatever, you moron!

797
01:07:53,200 --> 01:07:55,420
What the heck is your problem,
you loser?

798
01:07:56,760 --> 01:07:59,660
There's no way I'm gonna lose to you!

799
01:07:59,760 --> 01:08:00,940
Yeah, keep talking.

800
01:08:02,680 --> 01:08:03,680
Gotcha!

801
01:08:03,740 --> 01:08:05,460
Just get off me.

802
01:08:07,840 --> 01:08:12,300
I wonder if this is what it feels like to
have a brother.

803
01:08:14,060 --> 01:08:15,060
Why, Naruto?

804
01:08:16,800 --> 01:08:19,120
Why would you go so far from me?

805
01:08:19,700 --> 01:08:23,580
Because this is the first time I've ever
had a bond like this.

806
01:08:44,140 --> 01:08:48,100
That's why I'll do anything I can to stop
you!

807
01:08:55,960 --> 01:08:57,540
It's too late, Naruto.

808
01:08:59,240 --> 01:09:00,939
It's just too late.

809
01:09:02,740 --> 01:09:04,899
I can't turn back.

810
01:09:20,020 --> 01:09:21,040
Come, Naruto!

811
01:09:22,300 --> 01:09:25,899
If that's how it is, I'll just have to
sever that bond.

812
01:09:27,380 --> 01:09:29,520
Sever it just like that, huh?

813
01:09:31,680 --> 01:09:35,080
Then why do you even bother wearing that
headband anymore?

814
01:09:36,720 --> 01:09:37,760
I'll admit it.

815
01:09:38,340 --> 01:09:40,100
You're definitely strong.

816
01:09:40,660 --> 01:09:45,399
It's because you know the pain that
solitude brings, just as I do.

817
01:09:46,080 --> 01:09:49,460
It's that very pain that makes you and I
stronger, Naruto.

818
01:09:49,461 --> 01:09:52,606
Which means if I can
just break that bond,

819
01:09:52,607 --> 01:09:56,501
I'll be able to achieve
even greater strength.

820
01:09:57,220 --> 01:10:00,840
It's time you and I had this out,
as equals.

821
01:10:01,860 --> 01:10:06,440
But you're still not going to be able to
lay even a single scratch on my forehead.

822
01:10:07,420 --> 01:10:09,480
I know that hasn't changed at least.

823
01:10:10,360 --> 01:10:11,360
Fine.

824
01:10:11,440 --> 01:10:13,740
Guess there's no point in talking anymore.

825
01:10:15,060 --> 01:10:16,060
Sasuke!

826
01:10:17,180 --> 01:10:18,180
Enough.

827
01:10:18,220 --> 01:10:19,360
No more words.

828
01:10:20,040 --> 01:10:22,220
From here on out, we stick to fight.

829
01:10:23,420 --> 01:10:24,420
Come!

830
01:10:34,430 --> 01:10:35,590
I can see...

831
01:10:51,180 --> 01:10:53,760
His moves that were too fast for me
before.

832
01:10:54,300 --> 01:10:55,660
I can see them now.

833
01:10:57,920 --> 01:10:59,060
I can see...

834
01:11:12,030 --> 01:11:16,953
With every step, every
subtle shift in his momentum,

835
01:11:16,954 --> 01:11:21,630
the image of his next
move becomes vividly clear.

836
01:11:30,370 --> 01:11:35,010
As long as I have these eyes, I don't need
to expend any chakra.

837
01:11:36,050 --> 01:11:38,170
The curse mark would eat up too much of
it.

838
01:11:40,650 --> 01:11:44,405
With vision like this, I can
make out the image of Naruto's

839
01:11:44,406 --> 01:11:49,110
every move before it happens,
and time my attacks accordingly.

840
01:12:01,290 --> 01:12:03,050
This isn't good.

841
01:12:03,850 --> 01:12:06,690
He's totally reading my movements.

842
01:12:07,870 --> 01:12:09,370
What do I do?

843
01:13:00,440 --> 01:13:01,440
Sasuke!

844
01:13:11,940 --> 01:13:13,060
Flare Style!

845
01:13:13,260 --> 01:13:14,520
Dragon Flame Jutsu!

846
01:13:58,240 --> 01:13:59,260
Sasuke...

847
01:13:59,410 --> 01:14:00,960
It's too late, Naruto.

848
01:14:02,240 --> 01:14:04,100
It's too late now!

849
01:14:04,469 --> 01:14:05,469
Naruto!

850
01:14:36,460 --> 01:15:06,220
You're weak.

851
01:15:11,420 --> 01:15:16,380
You better be grateful to me...

852
01:15:17,300 --> 01:15:25,300
and to your beloved fourth Hokage,
who sealed me inside a twerp like you.

853
01:16:27,890 --> 01:16:29,290
Naruto!

854
01:16:29,291 --> 01:16:30,550
Naruto!

855
01:16:59,340 --> 01:17:07,920
What was that?

856
01:17:09,240 --> 01:17:11,540
I can still read his movements.

857
01:17:13,860 --> 01:17:15,260
This chakra...

858
01:17:15,990 --> 01:17:19,340
It's... it's almost like it has a mind of
its own.

859
01:17:21,060 --> 01:17:22,760
Even my eyes can't follow it.

860
01:17:24,100 --> 01:17:27,860
That red aura... that's no ordinary
chakra.

861
01:17:30,700 --> 01:17:33,380
I know that he's the one you're really
after.

862
01:17:33,720 --> 01:17:34,720
You're right.

863
01:17:35,180 --> 01:17:37,880
Naruto is the prize that the Akatsuki are
after.

864
01:17:38,760 --> 01:17:40,340
And we will have him.

865
01:17:41,860 --> 01:17:42,860
I see.

866
01:17:43,635 --> 01:17:46,560
So you have some kind of special power
then.

867
01:17:47,760 --> 01:17:49,740
I think I understand now!

868
01:18:00,950 --> 01:18:02,230
Fire Style!

869
01:18:02,430 --> 01:18:03,830
Fireball Jutsu!

870
01:18:05,810 --> 01:18:07,150
Fire Style!

871
01:18:07,151 --> 01:18:08,151
Fireball Jutsu!

872
01:18:21,630 --> 01:18:23,810
That chakra is protecting him?

873
01:18:29,450 --> 01:18:33,230
As long as I keep my distance,
I'll be fine.

874
01:19:31,620 --> 01:19:32,920
But what is he?

875
01:19:33,940 --> 01:19:35,920
All I can do is dodge.

876
01:20:05,040 --> 01:20:06,180
Oh well.

877
01:20:06,920 --> 01:20:08,880
No getting around it, I guess.

878
01:20:08,881 --> 01:20:12,880
Once I go ahead and let this power take
over...

879
01:20:13,700 --> 01:20:17,540
I... I'm not all that sure what will
happen to me in the end.

880
01:20:18,280 --> 01:20:22,320
But you're not leaving me a lot of choice
here, Naruto.

881
01:20:35,080 --> 01:20:37,720
There's no question that you're special.

882
01:20:40,900 --> 01:20:46,100
Unfortunately, you're not quite as special
as I am.

883
01:20:50,940 --> 01:20:51,940
Hehehehe...

884
01:20:58,960 --> 01:20:59,960
Sasuke...

885
01:21:08,520 --> 01:21:10,600
So you're special, huh?

886
01:21:11,360 --> 01:21:15,100
You won't be so special when I'm finished
with you!

887
01:21:17,500 --> 01:21:18,500
Hehehehe...

888
01:21:20,910 --> 01:21:22,760
There's no way I'm gonna lose!

889
01:21:45,100 --> 01:21:46,100
No!

890
01:22:34,610 --> 01:22:35,450
Sasuke!

891
01:22:35,451 --> 01:22:36,890
You're a monster!

892
01:22:44,610 --> 01:22:48,950
My body... I guess I can't waste any more
time.

893
01:22:58,680 --> 01:23:02,700
My left arm... I can't feel it anymore!

894
01:23:04,160 --> 01:23:06,040
That power of yours...

895
01:23:08,040 --> 01:23:11,780
By using it, you're taking a risk,
aren't you?

896
01:23:15,680 --> 01:23:17,000
Look around.

897
01:23:23,220 --> 01:23:25,080
You know where we are?

898
01:23:25,720 --> 01:23:28,080
It's called the Final Valley.

899
01:23:30,260 --> 01:23:32,920
The perfect setting for this fight.

900
01:23:34,220 --> 01:23:36,400
Isn't it, Naruto?

901
01:23:45,560 --> 01:23:46,560
Well...

902
01:23:46,840 --> 01:23:48,220
Oh right, of course.

903
01:23:49,180 --> 01:23:51,900
I said there'd be no more talking,
didn't I?

904
01:23:53,740 --> 01:23:56,680
In that case, I guess we're at the end.

905
01:23:57,560 --> 01:23:59,400
The end of this fight.

906
01:24:00,120 --> 01:24:02,560
And all the fights up to now.

907
01:24:46,435 --> 01:24:47,435
Chidori!

908
01:27:37,220 --> 01:27:40,020
The End

909
01:29:23,230 --> 01:29:27,450
And this is the second one.

910
01:30:01,640 --> 01:30:04,500
And this is the third one.

911
01:30:53,660 --> 01:30:58,320
And this is the fourth one.

912
01:30:59,680 --> 01:31:01,820
And Naruto would battle it out here.

913
01:31:04,960 --> 01:31:07,160
It's pretty ironic, don't you think?

914
01:31:09,580 --> 01:31:10,580
Yeah.

915
01:31:13,860 --> 01:31:15,240
Look at that river.

916
01:31:16,580 --> 01:31:19,640
The water just rages on for eternity.

917
01:31:20,600 --> 01:31:23,160
Like this epic, never-ending battle.

918
01:31:26,800 --> 01:31:30,640
As eternal as the two founders of the
Hidden Leaf Village.

919
01:31:31,680 --> 01:31:33,880
Forever standing as these statues.

920
01:31:38,120 --> 01:31:40,060
Naruto and Sasuke.

921
01:31:41,040 --> 01:31:44,480
As long as they live, the cycle will
continue.

922
01:32:02,700 --> 01:32:05,180
Naruto and Sasuke Take the life of your
best friend.

923
01:32:07,700 --> 01:32:09,160
You must kill him.

924
01:32:24,620 --> 01:32:25,740
No, brother.

925
01:32:26,840 --> 01:32:30,100
Just because you say it, doesn't mean I'm
gonna listen.

926
01:32:37,760 --> 01:32:40,480
I will get my hands on that power.

927
01:32:41,440 --> 01:32:43,800
But not the way you want me to.

928
01:32:44,620 --> 01:32:46,420
I'm going to surpass you.

929
01:32:46,920 --> 01:32:48,440
But I'll do it my way.

930
01:32:49,540 --> 01:32:50,540
I will.

931
01:33:02,840 --> 01:33:03,960
The storm.

932
01:33:04,620 --> 01:33:06,020
It finally broke.

933
01:33:24,410 --> 01:33:25,670
All that rain.

934
01:33:26,390 --> 01:33:27,970
I won't be able to follow his scent.

935
01:33:27,971 --> 01:33:33,810
But keeping Naruto alive is more important
than finding Sasuke.

936
01:33:34,710 --> 01:33:35,710
Yeah.

937
01:33:45,940 --> 01:33:47,240
Where's Sasuke?

938
01:33:54,740 --> 01:33:55,740
Kakashi!

939
01:33:56,620 --> 01:33:58,560
What's Naruto Uzumaki's condition?

940
01:33:58,980 --> 01:33:59,980
He'll pull through.

941
01:34:01,040 --> 01:34:02,040
And Sasuke?

942
01:34:02,280 --> 01:34:03,420
Sasuke Uchiha?

943
01:34:03,500 --> 01:34:04,060
What about him?

944
01:34:04,120 --> 01:34:05,120
What happened?

945
01:34:11,840 --> 01:34:13,260
How are the other genin?

946
01:34:14,460 --> 01:34:15,020
Oh, right.

947
01:34:15,400 --> 01:34:18,540
Lady Hokage dispatched the First and
Second Medical Corps to pick them up.

948
01:34:19,180 --> 01:34:21,240
Emergency treatment was administered on
the scene.

949
01:34:21,760 --> 01:34:25,260
Then they were all immediately
transported... to the hospital.

950
01:34:25,560 --> 01:34:26,580
They were all wounded?

951
01:34:27,020 --> 01:34:28,020
Yes.

952
01:34:28,100 --> 01:34:29,960
Shikamaru Nara is doing fine.

953
01:34:30,240 --> 01:34:31,320
Only minor injuries.

954
01:34:31,800 --> 01:34:34,620
Kiba Inuzukas are more serious,
but not life-threatening.

955
01:34:35,260 --> 01:34:39,140
However, Neji Hyuga and Choji Akimichi are
both in critical condition.

956
01:34:39,340 --> 01:34:41,900
At this point, they could go either way.

957
01:35:05,410 --> 01:35:06,410
Everyone...

958
01:35:07,950 --> 01:35:09,150
It's all here.

959
01:35:09,490 --> 01:35:10,490
Thoroughly researched.

960
01:35:10,870 --> 01:35:13,270
The medications, their effects,
and ingredients.

961
01:35:13,790 --> 01:35:14,790
This is excellent.

962
01:35:15,830 --> 01:35:17,670
I'm gonna need more of the deer antler.

963
01:35:17,990 --> 01:35:18,990
Yes, milady.

964
01:35:23,990 --> 01:35:26,110
Well, sis, how is he?

965
01:35:28,470 --> 01:35:29,470
He's fine.

966
01:35:32,390 --> 01:35:37,070
Well, no long walks for him anytime soon,
that's for sure.

967
01:35:37,950 --> 01:35:39,670
Can't you do anything for him?

968
01:35:39,890 --> 01:35:40,890
You're a vet!

969
01:35:40,990 --> 01:35:42,050
Not a magician.

970
01:35:42,530 --> 01:35:43,530
It takes time.

971
01:35:43,830 --> 01:35:45,910
But relax, his life's not in danger.

972
01:35:49,650 --> 01:35:52,410
No long walks for you anytime soon,
either.

973
01:35:54,150 --> 01:35:55,230
I got it.

974
01:35:55,350 --> 01:35:56,350
Don't worry.

975
01:35:57,150 --> 01:35:58,150
Aww...

976
01:36:10,290 --> 01:36:12,270
We've been at it almost three hours.

977
01:36:12,590 --> 01:36:13,670
Your turn to take over.

978
01:36:14,170 --> 01:36:14,530
Okay.

979
01:36:15,130 --> 01:36:18,590
We're using the boy's own hair as a
conductor, so focus on that.

980
01:36:18,810 --> 01:36:21,610
Try to accelerate the growth rate of the
injured cells.

981
01:36:21,950 --> 01:36:22,950
Right.

982
01:36:23,030 --> 01:36:26,170
As for the chakra control, just think of
threading a needle.

983
01:36:26,710 --> 01:36:27,710
Yes, I understand.

984
01:36:43,560 --> 01:36:48,420
A few hours later...

985
01:36:48,870 --> 01:36:51,060
No point in making yourself crazy,
you know.

986
01:36:52,340 --> 01:36:54,540
Don't you remember your psychological
training?

987
01:36:55,015 --> 01:36:56,820
With every mission comes sacrifice.

988
01:37:00,650 --> 01:37:03,570
Training and reality are two different
things.

989
01:37:05,170 --> 01:37:07,090
I thought I knew about missions.

990
01:37:07,091 --> 01:37:10,430
I thought I knew what it meant to be a
shinobi.

991
01:37:12,430 --> 01:37:17,130
Now, after this mission, my first as a
squad leader...

992
01:37:18,760 --> 01:37:20,090
Only one thing's clear.

993
01:37:21,320 --> 01:37:23,550
I'm just not cut out to be a shinobi.

994
01:37:24,415 --> 01:37:27,610
Honestly, all you men with such fragile
egos.

995
01:37:29,490 --> 01:37:34,630
This mission... I thought all I had to do
was depend on everybody else.

996
01:37:35,780 --> 01:37:41,250
Some leader... I should have done more,
but I didn't have the strength.

997
01:37:42,440 --> 01:37:43,790
It's all my fault.

998
01:37:45,195 --> 01:37:47,330
What are you afraid you might get hurt?

999
01:38:02,220 --> 01:38:06,780
Shikamaru... A girl disrespects
you like that and you just walk away?

1000
01:38:07,800 --> 01:38:08,800
You bet I do.

1001
01:38:08,830 --> 01:38:11,200
Standing around arguing's not my thing.

1002
01:38:11,440 --> 01:38:13,200
That's something girls like to do.

1003
01:38:13,650 --> 01:38:14,650
And what are you?

1004
01:38:15,240 --> 01:38:16,800
Not a man, that's for sure.

1005
01:38:17,250 --> 01:38:19,460
Far as I can see, you're nothing but a
coward.

1006
01:38:20,220 --> 01:38:22,780
You think if you quit, the missions will
stop?

1007
01:38:23,720 --> 01:38:24,840
Someone's gotta do it.

1008
01:38:26,520 --> 01:38:29,404
Your comrades will be
sent out again on other

1009
01:38:29,405 --> 01:38:31,840
missions, with someone
else leading them.

1010
01:38:32,460 --> 01:38:35,820
They'll face the same risks, and some of
them might not make it.

1011
01:38:36,440 --> 01:38:38,900
Ones you might have saved if you'd been
there to lead them.

1012
01:38:39,740 --> 01:38:41,560
How are you going to feel then?

1013
01:38:43,460 --> 01:38:47,240
You've got a chance to reflect on your
mistakes and to learn from them.

1014
01:38:47,720 --> 01:38:50,280
Use your failures to make yourself a
better leader.

1015
01:38:52,640 --> 01:38:55,100
You won't help your friends by running
away.

1016
01:38:55,600 --> 01:38:59,180
Instead, you should be trying to make
yourself stronger, for their sake.

1017
01:38:59,540 --> 01:39:03,260
So that the next mission goes perfectly,
and everyone gets back safe.

1018
01:39:03,840 --> 01:39:06,800
The choice is simple, you're either a
leader or a coward.

1019
01:39:07,260 --> 01:39:08,800
So, which are you?

1020
01:39:27,080 --> 01:39:28,080
Ah...

1021
01:39:28,240 --> 01:39:29,980
He's gonna be just fine.

1022
01:39:32,095 --> 01:39:33,420
The antidote worked.

1023
01:39:33,650 --> 01:39:37,020
The extermination of cells caused by the
pill's effects has been arrested.

1024
01:39:39,560 --> 01:39:41,720
I couldn't have done it without your help,
Shikaku.

1025
01:39:42,415 --> 01:39:45,120
The Nara Clan's Sacred Medicine Guide was
invaluable.

1026
01:39:47,020 --> 01:39:51,000
The work that went into that manual,
the years of research...

1027
01:39:51,001 --> 01:39:53,220
Well, it's quite impressive, to say the
least.

1028
01:39:54,045 --> 01:39:55,045
Thank you.

1029
01:39:55,700 --> 01:39:56,900
Lady Tsunami!

1030
01:40:01,660 --> 01:40:02,940
Neji Hyuga is safe.

1031
01:40:03,430 --> 01:40:04,620
His condition has stabilized.

1032
01:40:07,835 --> 01:40:09,200
And there's more.

1033
01:40:09,720 --> 01:40:12,091
I've just heard that
Kakashi Hatake and Naruto

1034
01:40:12,092 --> 01:40:14,941
Uzumaki have returned
and they've been examined.

1035
01:40:15,900 --> 01:40:18,620
Naruto's injuries are serious,
but not life-threatening.

1036
01:40:18,900 --> 01:40:19,960
He's going to be okay.

1037
01:40:29,840 --> 01:40:31,721
Shikamaru... Just two...

1038
01:40:32,180 --> 01:40:34,880
Shikamaru, your mission was a failure.

1039
01:40:40,150 --> 01:40:42,970
However, everyone's alive.

1040
01:40:43,510 --> 01:40:44,950
That's the most important thing.

1041
01:40:50,020 --> 01:40:53,740
Next time, the mission will go perfectly.

1042
01:41:11,730 --> 01:41:14,250
Sasuke... Sasuke, you
are the chosen one.

1043
01:41:14,650 --> 01:41:16,070
Yeah, yeah, whatever.

1044
01:41:16,750 --> 01:41:18,430
When are you going to give me the power?

1045
01:41:23,330 --> 01:41:24,670
A word of advice.

1046
01:41:25,065 --> 01:41:26,990
Watch what you say if you want to live
long.

1047
01:41:27,295 --> 01:41:29,230
Don't let his physical appearance fool
you.

1048
01:41:29,570 --> 01:41:31,990
That's still Lord Orochimaru you're
talking to.

1049
01:41:36,080 --> 01:41:37,560
The intensity of his chakra...

1050
01:41:38,730 --> 01:41:40,210
Yes, he's the one.

1051
01:41:40,599 --> 01:41:42,530
My future lies in him.

1052
01:41:53,820 --> 01:41:54,820
Well, well.

1053
01:41:55,570 --> 01:41:56,640
So you're awake, huh?

1054
01:41:58,220 --> 01:41:59,220
Shikamaru!

1055
01:42:01,840 --> 01:42:04,620
I was going to go check in on Choji and
see how he's doing.

1056
01:42:04,940 --> 01:42:05,500
How about you?

1057
01:42:05,880 --> 01:42:07,940
I just thought I'd look in on Naruto.

1058
01:42:08,375 --> 01:42:09,680
And Sasuke, if he's there.

1059
01:42:09,681 --> 01:42:11,080
I see.

1060
01:42:12,170 --> 01:42:14,000
Well, at least everybody's okay.

1061
01:42:15,380 --> 01:42:16,380
That's good.

1062
01:42:20,100 --> 01:42:24,560
So... so Sasuke's... Yeah.

1063
01:42:25,780 --> 01:42:26,780
He's gone.

1064
01:42:44,440 --> 01:42:46,640
So they're still not letting anyone in to
see him?

1065
01:42:47,240 --> 01:42:48,240
No.

1066
01:42:48,560 --> 01:42:51,320
But they say he'll be regaining
consciousness soon enough.

1067
01:42:51,385 --> 01:42:52,385
He'll be alright.

1068
01:42:54,490 --> 01:42:55,490
Thank goodness.

1069
01:42:56,560 --> 01:43:00,820
It was a fortunate day for this village
when Lady Tsunade agreed to come back.

1070
01:43:02,240 --> 01:43:05,900
If it weren't for her, Choji would have...

1071
01:43:06,650 --> 01:43:07,660
Lady Tsunade.

1072
01:43:08,490 --> 01:43:09,500
The fifth Hokage.

1073
01:43:19,960 --> 01:43:21,120
Here for a visit?

1074
01:43:22,610 --> 01:43:25,420
News travels fast, I see.

1075
01:43:31,165 --> 01:43:32,165
Sakura!

1076
01:43:35,560 --> 01:43:36,560
Naruto...

1077
01:43:40,320 --> 01:43:42,620
I'd heard that your injuries were pretty
serious.

1078
01:43:43,140 --> 01:43:44,920
You seem to be doing well, considering.

1079
01:43:50,520 --> 01:43:52,380
I'm... sorry, Sakura.

1080
01:43:56,160 --> 01:43:56,700
Sorry?

1081
01:43:56,940 --> 01:43:58,480
What have you got to be sorry about?

1082
01:44:03,545 --> 01:44:04,620
Let me guess.

1083
01:44:04,660 --> 01:44:07,120
You got reckless and went off half-cocked
again, huh?

1084
01:44:07,660 --> 01:44:08,660
Look at you now.

1085
01:44:08,860 --> 01:44:09,860
You look like a mummy.

1086
01:44:12,920 --> 01:44:13,920
I'm... so sorry.

1087
01:44:13,985 --> 01:44:16,200
Hey, why do you have the curtains closed?

1088
01:44:16,460 --> 01:44:17,980
It's a beautiful day outside.

1089
01:44:18,400 --> 01:44:19,400
See?

1090
01:44:23,865 --> 01:44:24,980
I haven't given up.

1091
01:44:25,350 --> 01:44:27,880
Listen, I'm still gonna keep my promise.

1092
01:44:29,180 --> 01:44:31,820
After all, it was the promise of a
lifetime, right?

1093
01:44:32,160 --> 01:44:33,160
I meant it!

1094
01:44:35,375 --> 01:44:36,375
It's okay, Naruto.

1095
01:44:37,440 --> 01:44:38,440
Really.

1096
01:44:39,430 --> 01:44:40,640
He tried, Sakura.

1097
01:44:40,880 --> 01:44:45,300
If I say I'm gonna do it, that means I
will, okay?

1098
01:44:46,500 --> 01:44:52,200
Don't forget, my way of the shinobi means
I always stand behind what I say!

1099
01:45:12,340 --> 01:45:13,340
Naruto...

1100
01:45:17,000 --> 01:45:18,200
Thanks, Naruto.

1101
01:45:23,810 --> 01:45:27,680
I've gotta focus on healing these injuries
if I'm gonna bring Sasuke back.

1102
01:45:31,920 --> 01:45:32,920
Huh?

1103
01:45:33,040 --> 01:45:34,480
What the heck is that?

1104
01:45:37,940 --> 01:45:38,580
Huh?

1105
01:45:38,960 --> 01:45:39,960
Pervy Sage?

1106
01:45:41,230 --> 01:45:42,230
Hey there.

1107
01:45:46,500 --> 01:45:48,280
What I have to tell you is important.

1108
01:45:48,500 --> 01:45:49,500
It can't wait.

1109
01:45:49,680 --> 01:45:51,720
From now on, you're my only student.

1110
01:45:52,165 --> 01:45:56,340
I need to make a full-fledged shinobi out
of you in three years, and I'll do it.

1111
01:45:56,625 --> 01:45:58,180
But why three years?

1112
01:45:58,920 --> 01:46:02,600
We've received some disturbing information
regarding the Akatsuki.

1113
01:46:04,010 --> 01:46:05,010
Akatsuki?

1114
01:46:05,980 --> 01:46:10,120
We've reasoned to believe you've been
chosen as their next target, and we have

1115
01:46:10,121 --> 01:46:12,600
three or four years before they come after
you.

1116
01:46:14,780 --> 01:46:16,700
No way, that's not gonna work!

1117
01:46:17,000 --> 01:46:19,500
I don't have time for that!

1118
01:46:19,810 --> 01:46:22,860
Do you think I care about what might
happen three years down the road?

1119
01:46:23,890 --> 01:46:25,180
What are you talking about?

1120
01:46:26,300 --> 01:46:29,880
Orochimaru's already got his hands on
Sasuke, and his life is in danger right now!

1121
01:46:29,980 --> 01:46:31,400
That's what I'm talking about!

1122
01:46:33,170 --> 01:46:37,620
I see you know all the gruesome details of
Orochimaru's little scheme.

1123
01:46:39,180 --> 01:46:41,180
Wait, you mean you knew all about it too?

1124
01:46:42,120 --> 01:46:43,120
Well, of course.

1125
01:46:43,300 --> 01:46:46,420
Don't you think I've been studying that
immortality jutsu of his?

1126
01:46:46,845 --> 01:46:51,280
That's also how I know our good friend
Orochimaru won't be able to reincarnate

1127
01:46:51,281 --> 01:46:54,060
himself in another body for at least three
more years.

1128
01:46:54,475 --> 01:46:56,847
Fortunately, he ran out
of time and had to take

1129
01:46:56,848 --> 01:47:00,021
over another body before
Sasuke could get there.

1130
01:47:00,140 --> 01:47:02,940
That means Sasuke is safe for three years.

1131
01:47:03,300 --> 01:47:04,620
So you do have time.

1132
01:47:05,080 --> 01:47:05,420
Really?

1133
01:47:05,800 --> 01:47:07,400
Are you sure of that, Purvey Sage?

1134
01:47:07,820 --> 01:47:09,440
Are you absolutely sure?

1135
01:47:11,800 --> 01:47:12,800
Yeah.

1136
01:47:18,320 --> 01:47:19,320
Forget Sasuke.

1137
01:47:21,500 --> 01:47:24,660
You can't help him, so just forget about
him.

1138
01:47:26,860 --> 01:47:30,380
Sasuke went to Orochimaru of his own free
will.

1139
01:47:30,900 --> 01:47:33,940
No matter what you do, he will not change.

1140
01:47:36,340 --> 01:47:39,320
I've seen many shinobi, so I know the
type.

1141
01:47:39,860 --> 01:47:42,720
Orochimaru and Sasuke are cut from the
same cloth.

1142
01:47:45,360 --> 01:47:48,740
Don't delude yourself into thinking that
you can bring him back.

1143
01:47:48,920 --> 01:47:49,640
You can't.

1144
01:47:49,780 --> 01:47:50,780
It's hopeless.

1145
01:47:50,900 --> 01:47:51,920
A fool's errand.

1146
01:47:52,420 --> 01:47:55,860
Maybe it's easy for you to give up on him,
Purvey Sage, but I can't!

1147
01:47:55,980 --> 01:47:58,280
He may mean nothing to you, but he's my
friend!

1148
01:47:58,500 --> 01:47:58,880
Idiot!

1149
01:47:58,980 --> 01:48:02,880
Just take a good look at the condition you're
in, and he's the one who did it to you!

1150
01:48:03,040 --> 01:48:04,320
Was that the work of a friend?

1151
01:48:07,220 --> 01:48:08,920
No, but.

1152
01:48:12,000 --> 01:48:11,700
..

1153
01:48:11,701 --> 01:48:12,701
Why?

1154
01:48:13,160 --> 01:48:14,800
Why are you doing this?

1155
01:48:15,460 --> 01:48:17,960
You and I have been comrades since
childhood.

1156
01:48:18,480 --> 01:48:20,990
Together we're part of the three legendary
Sannin.

1157
01:48:22,780 --> 01:48:26,240
What a sentimental fool you are,
Jiraiya.

1158
01:48:26,560 --> 01:48:29,300
You always were blind to reality.

1159
01:48:30,420 --> 01:48:34,620
You couldn't see, couldn't imagine what I
was really doing all along.

1160
01:48:35,140 --> 01:48:37,720
It's not too late to turn back,
Orochimaru.

1161
01:48:38,100 --> 01:48:39,100
Don't do this.

1162
01:48:41,700 --> 01:48:43,720
How'd you get to be such a fool?

1163
01:48:45,860 --> 01:48:47,960
All my pleading meant nothing.

1164
01:48:48,360 --> 01:48:50,180
He left us and would never return.

1165
01:48:51,140 --> 01:48:55,940
After the pain, all I was left with was a
sense of helplessness and regret.

1166
01:48:57,660 --> 01:49:01,580
Above all, I want to save you from going
through that, Naruto.

1167
01:49:05,920 --> 01:49:10,720
If you insist on going after Sasuke,
then you'll get no training from me.

1168
01:49:11,180 --> 01:49:13,118
I'll have the Anbu Black
Ops assigned to guard

1169
01:49:13,119 --> 01:49:16,061
you, to prevent you
from leaving the village.

1170
01:49:16,740 --> 01:49:18,640
You're not just some ordinary kid.

1171
01:49:18,780 --> 01:49:22,780
You've got something inside you the
Akatsuki want, the Nine-Tailed Fox.

1172
01:49:23,120 --> 01:49:26,740
But if you're going to behave like a kid
and not listen to what I tell you,

1173
01:49:26,960 --> 01:49:28,800
then I'll do what I have to do.

1174
01:49:32,200 --> 01:49:35,121
Eventually, you're going to
face enemies far worse than

1175
01:49:35,122 --> 01:49:37,980
Orochimaru, and it's time
you started preparing for them.

1176
01:49:38,760 --> 01:49:41,100
The first thing is for you to give up on
Sasuke.

1177
01:49:42,260 --> 01:49:44,220
What happened was destined to happen.

1178
01:49:44,680 --> 01:49:47,100
Dismiss him from your mind and move on.

1179
01:49:49,300 --> 01:49:52,900
To be a shinobi, you need more than
strength and jutsu.

1180
01:49:53,380 --> 01:49:56,180
You must acquire the judgment to make the
right decisions.

1181
01:49:56,660 --> 01:49:58,200
You must become smarter.

1182
01:49:58,201 --> 01:50:03,920
The longer you remain a fool, the harder
it will be for you to live in this world.

1183
01:50:06,520 --> 01:50:07,520
Fine, then.

1184
01:50:09,630 --> 01:50:14,780
If being smarter means what you say it
does, I'll remain a fool my entire life.

1185
01:50:16,660 --> 01:50:19,720
I'm going after him, and I'll do it alone
if I have to!

1186
01:50:20,000 --> 01:50:23,860
I'll create my own incredible jutsu,
and whenever the Akatsuki show up,

1187
01:50:24,060 --> 01:50:25,440
I'll smack them down!

1188
01:50:29,400 --> 01:50:29,960
Go!

1189
01:50:30,320 --> 01:50:31,320
Go!

1190
01:50:39,820 --> 01:50:44,580
The thought of my leaving you to
come up with jutsu on your own...

1191
01:50:44,581 --> 01:50:49,460
like that idiotic, sexy jutsu of
yours... no, it's too depressing.

1192
01:50:53,620 --> 01:50:55,480
This is more than foolish.

1193
01:50:55,760 --> 01:50:59,620
It's so colossally foolish, it might even
work.

1194
01:51:00,400 --> 01:51:02,947
We've got a lot of work
to do when you get out of

1195
01:51:02,948 --> 01:51:05,621
the hospital, so be ready
to hit the ground running!

1196
01:51:06,700 --> 01:51:07,820
See you then.

1197
01:51:08,640 --> 01:51:09,640
You got it!

